
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0d12"><title>KALKI — Personal AI Assistant</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css?v=assistant-2">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <header class="app-header"><button class="icon-button menu-button" type="button" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button><div class="brand-lockup"><img class="brand-logo" src="1789578396977-559ec457.jpg" alt="KALKI logo"><div><h1>KALKI</h1><p><span class="status-dot"></span> Personal assistant</p></div></div><button id="clear-btn" class="icon-button" type="button" aria-label="Clear conversation">⌫</button></header>
    <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Primary sections"><button class="primary-nav-link is-active" data-section="assistant" type="button"><span>✦</span><b>KALKI Assistant</b><small>Chat & tools</small></button><button class="primary-nav-link" data-section="agents" type="button"><span>◇</span><b>KALKI Agents</b><small>Skills & hub</small></button><button class="primary-nav-link" data-section="automations" type="button"><span>⟲</span><b>KALKI Automations</b><small>Workflows</small></button></nav>
    <main id="assistant-section" class="section-view assistant-main"><section class="welcome" aria-label="Welcome"><div class="welcome-orb">✦</div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR AI COMPANION</p><h2>How can I help<br><em>today?</em></h2><p class="welcome-copy">Ask me anything, or give me an explicit command. Your conversations stay on this device.</p><div class="suggestions" aria-label="Suggestions"><button type="button" onclick="document.getElementById('msg').value='Help me plan my day';document.getElementById('msg').focus()">Plan my day <span>→</span></button><button type="button" onclick="document.getElementById('msg').value='Search the web for ';document.getElementById('msg').focus()">Search the web <span>→</span></button></div></section><section id="smart-command-center" class="smart-command-center" aria-labelledby="smart-command-title"><div class="smart-command-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">SMART COMMAND CENTER</p><h2 id="smart-command-title">Morning brief, on your terms</h2><p class="smart-command-copy">A read-only snapshot of available sources. Connectors are never contacted until you explicitly ask.</p></div><button id="smart-command-refresh" class="brief-refresh" type="button" aria-label="Refresh source states">↻ Refresh</button></div><div class="brief-controls"><label class="brief-optin"><input id="brief-optin" type="checkbox"><span class="brief-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Include in my brief</strong><small>Opt in for this device only · off by default</small></span></label><span id="brief-last-refresh" class="brief-timestamp">State checked locally</span></div><div id="brief-source-grid" class="brief-source-grid" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="brief-priority"><div><span class="brief-icon">◈</span><div><strong>Priorities</strong><small>Context packs · local only</small></div></div><span class="brief-state state-pending">Pending</span></div><div class="brief-preview"><div class="brief-preview-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">PREVIEW ONLY</p><strong>Brief composition</strong></div><button id="brief-compose" type="button">Compose preview</button></div><p id="brief-preview-text" role="status">No brief composed. Choose “Compose preview” to see what can be included; no live data is inferred.</p></div><p class="brief-boundary">No background refresh, proactive notifications, message sending, task changes, or calendar actions are enabled.</p></section><section id="context-packs" class="context-packs" aria-labelledby="context-packs-title"><div class="context-packs-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL CONTEXT PACKS</p><h2 id="context-packs-title">Give KALKI the right context</h2><p>Choose a pack for this chat, an agent preview, or an automation preview. Nothing runs automatically.</p></div><span class="local-badge">● LOCAL ONLY</span></div><div id="context-pack-list" class="context-pack-list" role="listbox" aria-label="Context packs"></div><div class="context-editor"><label>Applies to<select id="context-target"><option value="chat">This chat</option><option value="agent">Selected agent</option><option value="automation">Selected automation</option></select></label><label>Context notes<textarea id="context-notes" rows="3" maxlength="1200" placeholder="Add non-sensitive preferences, goals, constraints, or background…"></textarea></label><div class="context-actions"><button id="context-save" type="button">Save pack</button><button id="context-clear" type="button" class="quiet">Clear selected</button></div><p id="context-status" class="context-status" role="status">No context selected. Add only information you are comfortable keeping in this browser.</p></div></section><section id="smart-document-room" class="smart-doc-room" aria-labelledby="smart-doc-title"><div class="smart-doc-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">SMART DOCUMENT ROOM</p><h2 id="smart-doc-title">Review files privately</h2><p>Local preview first. Choose an explicit document action; nothing is uploaded or sent by default.</p></div><span class="doc-privacy-badge">● LOCAL PREVIEW</span></div><div class="doc-dropzone"><input id="document-file-input" type="file" accept=".pdf,.txt,.md,.csv,.json,.log,.xml,.html,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp,.gif,application/pdf,text/plain,image/*" multiple hidden><button id="document-upload-btn" type="button" class="doc-upload-btn">＋ Choose files</button><span>PDF, images, text & common files</span><small id="document-status" role="status">No document selected. Files stay in this browser unless you explicitly choose another action.</small></div><div id="document-file-list" class="document-file-list" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="document-preview" class="document-preview"><div class="doc-empty"><span>▣</span><strong>Preview area</strong><small>Select a file to preview it locally. Unsupported formats remain available as file metadata only.</small></div></div><div class="document-actions" role="group" aria-label="Document actions"><button type="button" data-doc-action="summarize">Summarize</button><button type="button" data-doc-action="fields">Extract key fields</button><button type="button" data-doc-action="compare">Compare two documents</button><button type="button" data-doc-action="translate">Translate</button><button type="button" data-doc-action="dates">Identify dates / amounts</button><button type="button" data-doc-action="actions">Create action list</button></div><div id="document-result" class="document-result" role="status"><strong>Action boundary</strong><span>Results are preview-only. Any resulting reminder, message, file change, or sharing needs a separate explicit approval.</span></div></section>
<section id="chat" class="chat" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Conversation"></section><section id="kalki-share-preview" class="share-preview" hidden aria-label="Shared content preview"><div class="share-preview-head"><strong>SHARED WITH KALKI</strong><button id="share-dismiss" type="button" aria-label="Dismiss shared content">×</button></div><p id="share-summary" class="share-summary"></p><div id="share-files" class="share-files"></div><div class="share-actions" role="group" aria-label="Choose a draft action"><button type="button" data-share-action="Summarize">Summarize</button><button type="button" data-share-action="Extract">Extract</button><button type="button" data-share-action="Translate">Translate</button><button type="button" data-share-action="Draft reply">Draft reply</button></div><small>Preview only. Choose an action to prepare a draft; nothing is sent or executed without your approval.</small></section><section id="action-safety-center" class="safety-center" aria-labelledby="safety-center-title"><div class="safety-center-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">ACTION SAFETY CENTER</p><h2 id="safety-center-title">Review before anything leaves KALKI</h2><p>Every staged request stays local until you explicitly decide. No background replies, provider calls, or schedule creation happen here.</p></div><span class="safety-locked">● LOCKED BY DEFAULT</span></div><div id="safety-empty" class="safety-empty">No pending actions. Agent and automation previews appear here for review.</div><div id="safety-action-list" class="safety-action-list" aria-live="polite"></div><p class="safety-boundary"><strong>Confirmation boundary:</strong> preview/edit is safe; external sending, sharing, file changes, and scheduling always require a new explicit confirmation after connector verification.</p></section><section id="offline-quick-actions" class="offline-quick-actions" aria-labelledby="offline-quick-actions-title"><div class="offline-actions-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">OFFLINE QUICK ACTIONS</p><h2 id="offline-quick-actions-title">Useful on-device shortcuts</h2><p>Works locally when Android permits. Choose an action, review the confirmation, then approve it. KALKI never sends, changes settings, or starts listeners automatically.</p></div><span id="offline-bridge-status" class="local-badge">Checking bridge…</span></div><div id="offline-permission-status" class="offline-status" role="status">Status is checked locally; no permission is requested until you choose an action.</div><div class="offline-action-grid" role="group" aria-label="Offline quick actions"><button type="button" data-offline-action="whatsapp"><span>◌</span><strong>Open WhatsApp</strong><small>Launch only · no message is sent</small></button><button type="button" data-offline-action="camera"><span>⌾</span><strong>Open Camera</strong><small>Android camera handoff · permission may be required</small></button><button type="button" data-offline-action="app-settings"><span>⚙</span><strong>App settings</strong><small>Review KALKI permissions yourself</small></button><button type="button" data-offline-action="notification-settings"><span>♢</span><strong>Notification settings</strong><small>Review notifications yourself</small></button><button type="button" data-offline-action="battery-settings"><span>◒</span><strong>Battery settings</strong><small>Review Android battery controls</small></button><button type="button" data-offline-action="timer"><span>◷</span><strong>Local timer</strong><small>Runs in this page only</small></button><button type="button" data-offline-action="stopwatch"><span>◴</span><strong>Stopwatch</strong><small>Runs in this page only</small></button><button type="button" data-offline-action="note"><span>✎</span><strong>Local note preview</strong><small>Saved on this device only</small></button></div><div id="offline-local-tool" class="offline-local-tool" hidden></div><p id="offline-action-status" class="offline-action-status" role="status">No offline action selected.</p><p class="offline-boundary"><strong>Boundary:</strong> Android controls vary by device. KALKI can hand off to settings/apps but cannot toggle system settings, read notifications, send WhatsApp messages, or guarantee a timer survives app closure.</p></section></main>
    <main id="agents-section" class="section-view workspace-view" hidden><div class="workspace-heading agents-heading"><p class="eyebrow">KALKI AGENTS</p><h2>Your agent hub</h2><p>Choose a capability to inspect its safe operating boundary. Agents are previews only until a verified backend router exists.</p></div><div class="agent-layout"><div class="agent-grid" id="agent-grid" aria-label="Built-in agents"></div><section class="agent-detail" id="agent-detail" aria-live="polite"><div class="detail-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">SELECTED AGENT</p><h3 id="agent-detail-title">Research</h3></div><span class="state-pill muted-pill" id="agent-detail-status">Preview only</span></div><p id="agent-detail-purpose" class="detail-purpose"></p><div class="detail-meta"><div><span>Allowed tools</span><strong id="agent-detail-tools"></strong></div><div><span>Execution boundary</span><strong id="agent-detail-boundary"></strong></div></div><div class="run-preview"><div><p class="eyebrow">SAFE RUN PREVIEW</p><h4>Stage an intent, never an action</h4></div><textarea id="agent-preview-input" rows="2" placeholder="Describe what you would ask this agent to do…"></textarea><button id="agent-preview-btn" type="button">Generate preview</button><p id="agent-preview-output" class="preview-output" role="status">Nothing staged. No tools will be called and no result will be invented.</p></div></section></div><p class="workspace-note">Explicit action only · Read-only capabilities stay read-only; approval-required actions are never executed from this preview.</p></main>
    <main id="automations-section" class="section-view workspace-view" hidden>
      <div class="workspace-heading automation-heading"><div class="heading-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">KALKI AUTOMATIONS</p><h2>Workflows, safely staged</h2><p>Build an explicit request, inspect every step, then decide what happens next. Preview is not execution.</p></div><span class="safety-badge">● PREVIEW-FIRST</span></div></div>
      <section class="automation-compose" aria-label="Automation preview builder"><div class="compose-copy"><span class="compose-icon">＋</span><div><strong>Stage a workflow</strong><small>Use a clear command such as “create a reminder, then draft an email”.</small></div></div><div class="compose-row"><input id="automation-command" type="text" placeholder="Describe an explicit workflow…" autocomplete="off"><button id="automation-preview-btn" type="button">Preview workflow</button></div><p id="automation-status" class="automation-status" role="status">Nothing staged. No provider will be called from this preview.</p></section>
      <section class="automation-grid" aria-label="Automation workflows"><div class="workflow-list" id="workflow-list"><div class="empty-workflows"><span>◇</span><strong>No workflows staged</strong><small>Preview an explicit request to see its trigger, conditions, actions, and approval boundary.</small></div></div><aside class="workflow-detail" id="workflow-detail" aria-live="polite"><div class="detail-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">WORKFLOW INSPECTOR</p><h3 id="workflow-title">Ready for preview</h3></div><span id="workflow-state" class="state-pill muted-pill">Idle</span></div><p id="workflow-summary" class="workflow-summary">Every request remains local to this inspector until you explicitly preview it.</p><div id="workflow-steps" class="workflow-steps"><div class="step-placeholder">Trigger → condition → action → approval</div></div><div class="provider-row"><span>Provider boundary</span><strong id="workflow-provider">No provider selected</strong></div><div class="workflow-actions"><button id="workflow-schedule" type="button" disabled>Schedule</button><button id="workflow-cancel" type="button" disabled>Cancel</button><button id="workflow-undo" type="button" disabled>Undo</button></div><p class="workflow-footnote">Controls are safe scaffolding. Scheduling is not available yet; approval never executes a provider action in this build.</p></aside></section><p class="workspace-note">Explicit action only · Connected labels are reported by the backend; “pending” means authorization or runtime support is still required.</p>
    </main>
    <div class="composer-wrap"><div class="composer" role="group" aria-label="Message composer"><button class="composer-icon" type="button" aria-label="Attach a file">＋</button><input id="msg" type="text" placeholder="Message KALKI..." autocomplete="off" enterkeyhint="send"><button id="mic-btn" class="composer-icon" type="button" aria-label="Use voice input">🎙</button><button id="send" class="send-button" type="button" aria-label="Send message">↑</button></div><p class="safe-note"><span>✦</span> JARVIS only takes action when you explicitly ask.</p></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="side-sheet" aria-label="Navigation"><button class="sheet-close" type="button" aria-label="Close menu">×</button><p class="eyebrow">KALKI</p><h2>Workspace</h2><button class="sheet-link" type="button">＋ New conversation</button><button class="sheet-link" data-section="assistant" type="button">✦ Assistant</button><button class="sheet-link" data-section="agents" type="button">◇ Agents</button><button class="sheet-link" data-section="automations" type="button">⟲ Automations</button><a class="sheet-link" href="connectors.html">◇ Connectors</a><button id="settings-toggle" class="sheet-link" type="button" aria-expanded="false">⚙ Settings</button><section id="voice-settings" class="voice-settings" hidden aria-label="Voice settings"><div class="voice-setting-row"><div><strong>Wake word</strong><small>Foreground only · “Hey Jarvis”</small></div><label class="switch"><input id="wake-word-toggle" type="checkbox"><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sr-only">Enable wake word</span></label></div><p id="wake-word-status" class="voice-status">Off. JARVIS will not use your microphone.</p><button id="wake-word-stop" class="voice-stop" type="button" hidden>Stop listening</button><p class="voice-disclaimer">Requires microphone permission. WebView cannot provide reliable background wake-word listening; keep JARVIS open and in the foreground.</p></section><section id="personality-settings" class="personality-settings" hidden aria-label="KALKI personality and memory settings"><div class="settings-heading"><strong>Personality & privacy</strong><small>Saved on this device · explicit control only</small></div><label class="setting-field">Response language<select id="pref-language"><option value="auto">Auto (match my message)</option><option value="english">English</option><option value="telugu">తెలుగు</option><option value="teluglish">Teluglish</option></select></label><label class="setting-field">Response style<select id="pref-style"><option value="short">Short & direct</option><option value="detailed">Detailed</option></select></label><label class="setting-field">How should KALKI address you?<input id="pref-name" maxlength="60" placeholder="Optional name or alias"></label><div class="settings-actions"><button id="save-preferences" type="button">Save preferences</button><button id="clear-personal-data" type="button" class="quiet">Clear personal data</button></div><p id="preferences-status" class="settings-status" role="status">Not saved yet.</p><details><summary>Custom aliases</summary><p class="settings-help">Map a phrase to an explicit command. Aliases never run in the background.</p><div class="alias-row"><input id="alias-phrase" maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. latest AI news cheppu"><input id="alias-command" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. search latest AI news"><button id="add-alias" type="button">Add</button></div><ul id="alias-list" class="settings-list"></ul></details><details><summary>User-defined skills</summary><p class="settings-help">Describe a skill for KALKI to route after you explicitly ask. No code or secrets are executed here.</p><div class="skill-form"><input id="custom-skill-name" maxlength="50" placeholder="Skill name"><input id="custom-skill-trigger" maxlength="80" placeholder="Trigger phrase"><textarea id="custom-skill-description" maxlength="300" placeholder="What should it do?"></textarea><button id="add-custom-skill" type="button">Add skill</button></div><ul id="custom-skill-list" class="settings-list"></ul></details></section><a class="sheet-link" href="admin.html">▣ Admin dashboard</a></aside><div class="sheet-backdrop"></div>
  <script src="script.js?v=phase11"></script><script>const menu=document.querySelector('.menu-button'),sheet=document.querySelector('.side-sheet'),backdrop=document.querySelector('.sheet-backdrop');function toggleMenu(open){document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open',open)}menu?.addEventListener('click',()=>toggleMenu(true));document.querySelector('.sheet-close')?.addEventListener('click',()=>toggleMenu(false));backdrop?.addEventListener('click',()=>toggleMenu(false));const sectionButtons=document.querySelectorAll('[dat
